WEBVTT

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.280
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.760
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.040
Let go of me!

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.880
-You little wretches! -Let go of me!

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.960
Still trying to run?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.200
Run, and I'll

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.640
Kill your precious Sister Ah Xiang.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.160
Tinghui...

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.000
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.120
I'll kill you!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.800
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.000
(This story is entirely fictional.)

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.560
Young Master, Shazhou lies just ahead.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.520
Our shadow guards report

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.200
Weapons are being sold illegally from this military stronghold.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.240
Governor Ding Chong is behind it.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.040
The Left Chancellor's favorite protégé.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.360
Find out how deeply the Left Chancellor is involved

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.520
Before the ritual retreat ends.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.400
Take the proof back to the capital.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.600
Understood.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.440
It's Huo An.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.440
The Left Chancellor clearly doesn't want me investigating this.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.400
Young Master,

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.000
I'll deal with them.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.000
Stick to the plan.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:20.920
Split up.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:24.800
Huo An!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.720
Get past me first.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.800
Attack!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.760
Hot steamed buns!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.720
Predicted Questions for the Women's Provincial Exam!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.520
The only copy in all of Shazhou!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.960
First come, first served!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.240
Meng Tinghui, how much for this set of predictions?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.120
Bidding starts at 30 taels.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.360
-Thirty taels? -Thirty taels?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.480
Last month's academy exam predictions

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.880
Were only ten taels!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.240
This is the provincial exam.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.320
Women were barred from exams for nine years.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.600
Now His Majesty has reopened a special examination.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.640
Anyone who passes becomes an imperial protégé

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.080
And is set for a brilliant career.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.360
Even 1,000 taels would be worth it.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.240
In last month's academy exam,

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.840
You predicted three essay questions.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.080
I want this set.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.000
Thirty-five taels.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.480
Her questions put me near the top last time.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:22.400
I bid 40.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.720
Forty-five.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.720
Fifty.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.000
-Sold! -Let's see who dares buy it!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.240
Jiang Mei'er.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.160
You...

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.600
Don't. Have you forgotten?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.920
Last month, Wen Xiaomei merely talked back to her,

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.360
And was expelled from the academy.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.120
My uncle is the governor of Shazhou.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.600
He funds this entire academy.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.560
Cross me,

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:00.480
And none of you will have a place in Shazhou.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.520
Why do you care if I sell predictions?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:03.840
Meng Tinghui!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.960
If you didn't sell predictions every month,

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.600
Would I always come in dead last?

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:10.520
You could buy them too.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.280
My uncle decreed

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.640
A 100-tael fee for the women's special examination.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.520
You're a penniless orphan.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.160
You can't marry into a powerful family

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.800
Or run some lucrative business.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.240
Now you dream of changing your fate through the examination.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.200
You think you're worthy?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.720
You rely on your family.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.720
I rely on my ability.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:32.640
Worthy or not,

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.840
Will be decided in the exam.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.000
What if your registration form were to blow away?

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.480
Could you still take the exam?

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.000
You...

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.400
Why did you take my registration form?

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.440
My uncle is the governor of Shazhou.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.640
All you ever talk about is your uncle.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.240
You may not tire of saying it, but we're tired of hearing it.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.760
Who dares laugh?

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.280
Meng Tinghui.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.200
We are classmates, after all.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.200
If you kneel

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.120
And beg me sincerely,

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.320
I might just

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.920
Show some mercy

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.720
And return my form.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:13.800
Go on. Kneel.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.760
Wait too long and the offer's gone.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.000
If you want someone kneeling, do it yourself.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.280
You dare hit me?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.000
Jiang Mei'er!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.000
Give me back my registration form.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.280
Shazhou is only a tiny corner of the realm.

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.200
I'll live to see the law punish you

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.520
And wipe those bullying smirks from your faces.

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.880
And what can you do to me?

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.280
People are born into different worlds.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.360
My uncle rules Shazhou.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.720
What can you possibly do?

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.880
I'll fight you with my life.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.640
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.520
If you don't want your face ruined,

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.960
Give me back the form.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.640
-Give it back! -A-Xia!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.520
A-Xia, give it back to her! Hurry!

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.800
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.320
Meng Tinghui is killing someone!

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.120
You two little brats!

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.520
I took you in and fed you.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.200
I even taught you skills.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.120
And you still tried to run?

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.640
You force us to steal and swindle.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.240
That's not teaching.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.080
You work us like animals.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.400
And that's not raising us.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.240
Without me,

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.840
You two would've starved to death.

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:19.000
I'm not afraid to die.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.520
But we want to watch you die.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.520
If I ever hold the knife,

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.760
I'll cut you into a thousand pieces.

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:27.480
Is this how you repay your benefactor?

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.560
You're no benefactor.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.720
You abduct women and traffic children.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:32.960
You murder at will.

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.400
You're guilty of every vile crime.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:39.800
You say I'm guilty?

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.320
Where's the evidence? The charge?

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.200
Who convicted me?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.520
You?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.560
A little beggar?

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.160
Who would believe your empty accusations?

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.640
The officials all call me an honest citizen.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:54.960
But you...

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.280
A little swindler

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.120
Who wants to kill someone...

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.720
That makes you

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.200
A murderer.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.800
Mengmeng!

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.880
I heard Jiang Mei'er came after you again.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.280
Does she think we're easy prey?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.560
I failed the academy exam.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:20.760
Expulsion doesn't scare me.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:21.760
I...

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:24.000
I'll bash her to death with my abacus

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:24.960
And get even for you.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:26.560
Come back.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.240
Not with that.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:30.760
That abacus

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.640
Is all your mother left you.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.480
It'd be a terrible waste to hit her with it.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.200
Did Jiang Mei'er do this?

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.000
You need that hand for the exam.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.120
I'll tear her apart right now.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:44.280
Come back.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.880
She didn't get the better of me.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.040
I took her dagger

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.880
And nearly slit her throat.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.240
You should've seen Jiang Mei'er,

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.480
Scared out of her wits

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.080
And fleeing for her life.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.000
Sit still.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:24.760
Didn't we agree

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.840
You'd focus on your studies

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.320
And not confront her head-on?

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.240
This time was different.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.680
She threatened me with my form.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.800
Here. I got it back.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.960
Ever since I met you,

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.080
You've

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.560
Worked odd jobs by day to pay your tuition

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.400
And studied late into the night.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.000
I know you've always dreamed

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.240
Of one day taking the imperial exam.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.240
But to me,

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.280
Nothing is worth risking your life for.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:00.520
I'm an orphan from the streets.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.240
Even Hell won't take me.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.320
No.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.400
Jiang Mei'er never lets a grudge go.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.680
You can't stay in the dorm now.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.040
Pack your things and come live with me.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:26.600
Fuzhi.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:31.680
Maybe we shouldn't.

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.960
Every time I go to your home,

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.280
Your stepmother watches me like a thief.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.560
Then move into Bofeng House.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.200
Did your father and stepmother

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.080
Agree to let you run Bofeng House?

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:51.600
They say a stepmother turns your father against you.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.600
My stepmother

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.480
Won't let me forget I failed the exam.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.760
She handed me Bofeng House, which was nearly bankrupt

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:58.760
And declared,

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.880
"If you don't earn 300 taels in one month,

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.440
You'll come home and get married."

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.840
But are women born to be trapped at home?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.880
I may be no scholar,

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.240
But I'm excellent with an abacus.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:12.680
I know how to run a business too,

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.240
Yet they refuse to value that.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:15.480
Fuzhi.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.560
Let's go make our way in the capital.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.200
You open a restaurant; I'll pass the exam.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.400
Right under the emperor's nose,

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:26.320
The two of us are bound to succeed.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.080
I'd love nothing more.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.600
But now they're trying to force me into marriage.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.920
That's been worrying me.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.320
I'll find a solution.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:38.800
Really?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.280
You still need to save the entrance fee.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.320
We'll make money together

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.280
And get through this.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.720
We'll get through it.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.440
Situ Xue!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:56.680
Situ Xue is here!

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.360
Who's Situ Xue?

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:08.680
She's the capital's top dancer.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.880
Anything she eats or uses

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.000
Becomes wildly popular.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.320
At the Flower Festival,

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.760
Even His Majesty praised her.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:17.840
-Situ Xue! -Situ Xue!

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.360
Situ Xue!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.160
Situ Xue!

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.160
I got one!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.480
Situ Xue!

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:32.920
There's enough for everyone. Here.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.600
Today, Bofeng House offers music, dance and more.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:39.480
All of Miss Situ's handmade "Spring Blossom, Autumn Moon" treats

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:40.920
Are 20% off.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.120
Come see Situ Xue at Bofeng House!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.120
Situ Xue!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.760
Honored guests,

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.800
Bofeng House reopens today.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.280
We have specially invited Situ Xue,

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:55.480
To perform in person.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.280
-Wonderful! -Wonderful!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.000
Every guest who enters

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:02.080
Can enjoy Miss Situ's music and dance up close.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.400
For three days only.

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.240
-Wonderful! -Wonderful!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.640
Please welcome Miss Situ!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.760
Black Tiger Hall's matriarch has passed away.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.520
Pay your respects voluntarily.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:49.920
Mourn voluntarily.

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:53.720
Put it on!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.200
I will! I will!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.080
Black Tiger Hall's matriarch has passed away.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.360
Pay your respects voluntarily.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.320
Mourn voluntarily.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:14.680
(Feng Lu)

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:00.320
Let's talk this through.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:01.560
Get down.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:03.960
Come out.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:05.920
My bride!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.480
Get away!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:08.400
My bride!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.520
I'm collecting my bride today.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.000
How can I wear mourning clothes?

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.120
You talk too damn much.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.240
My husband!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.240
My husband!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.440
My husband!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.280
My husband!

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.040
My husband!

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.040
My husband!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.840
My husband!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:37.880
My husband!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.080
My husband!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.280
Bofeng House is finally coming back to life.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.360
The camels and flower carts were worth every tael.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.480
This is wonderful!

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.920
Today is my mother's funeral,

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.720
And yet

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.440
Someone dares celebrate a grand opening?

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.480
Men!

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.960
Black Tiger Hall is here!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.000
Run!

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.280
Black Tiger Hall is in mourning.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:49.320
Close up. Send them home.

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:57.920
Black Tiger Hall's matriarch died today.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.240
Yet you dress like a harlot.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:00.720
You're defying Black Tiger Hall.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.760
Please, calm down.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:04.160
We'll change into mourning clothes now

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:05.520
And mourn her in sackcloth

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:06.880
To show our respects.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.920
You've desecrated her day of mourning.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.480
Then I'll turn this celebration into a funeral.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.960
I'm the proprietor of Bofeng House.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.400
She is my honored guest.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.440
Take it out on me.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.760
Gladly.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:27.320
Playing hero for her?

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.760
Do you know who backs Black Tiger Hall?

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.560
Ding Chong, Governor Ding.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.840
He rules Shazhou.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.320
Black Tiger Hall outnumbers us.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.600
We can't afford to provoke them.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.200
Don't worry.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.560
You needn't fear them, miss.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.040
Big words, young master.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.520
You may not be afraid,

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.120
But don't drag Bofeng House into this.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.040
Insolent! How dare you...

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:12.880
Shazhou army issue.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:14.520
Why have an army-issued blade?

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:15.520
Keep it if you like it.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.560
He provoked Black Tiger Hall on his own.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.200
It has nothing to do with Bofeng House.

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.200
Fuzhi.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.240
Mengmeng, on opening day we crossed Black Tiger Hall.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.720
How can we keep doing business now?

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.640
Don't worry.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.200
Someone is charging into the tiger's jaws for us.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.720
He doesn't look like he's from Shazhou.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.440
He may be able to handle them.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.720
Fuzhi,

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.000
Go home through the back door.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.040
Lie low for now.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.120
No.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.240
You did this to help me.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:52.560
How could I abandon you?

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.480
They don't even know what I look like.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.440
If your father hears about today from someone else,

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.600
He'll blame you again.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.200
Go home and explain it to him first,

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:01.920
Before your stepmother uses it against you.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:05.400
Then hide upstairs.

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:06.520
I'll come back tomorrow.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:07.560
-All right. -All right.

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.400
Young master,

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:49.720
We're closed for the day.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.320
Please go elsewhere.

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:56.240
You invaded a woman's private room.

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:58.240
Leave now, or I'll call for help.

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:00.280
Go.

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:06.400
Where did you get that dagger?

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:08.880
I found it on the road.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:14.320
Custom-made by the Shazhou Arsenal Bureau.

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:16.000
Quite a find.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:18.800
I'm merely a commoner.

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.520
How would I know military gear?

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.800
Why do you know it so well?

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:24.680
Are you a deserter?

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.360
Are those men outside hunting you?

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:29.520
You just used me to escape.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.080
Repaying a favor with betrayal already?

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:34.400
Please leave at once.

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:35.320
Stop pestering me.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:39.160
You impersonated Situ Xue and fooled the public.

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.520
You hid an army weapon with criminal intent.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:42.920
The law calls for exile.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.520
What proves I'm an impostor?

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:55.920
Because I once met

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:57.760
The real Situ Xue.

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:01.200
Guards!

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:20.600
Stop!

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:23.080
Did you sleep well?

00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:26.160
Give me back my form.

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.640
Where's the weapon from?

00:24:29.560 --> 00:24:30.720
It belongs to Jiang Mei'er.

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:31.640
Go on.

00:24:32.280 --> 00:24:34.400
Her uncle is Ding Chong, governor of Shazhou.

00:24:35.320 --> 00:24:37.880
I took it accidentally during a fight at school.

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:40.000
Black Tiger Hall runs rampant through Shazhou,

00:24:40.560 --> 00:24:43.800
While Ding Chong sits comfortably as governor.

00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:45.640
Black Tiger Hall is his enforcer.

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:49.000
For years, they've seized farmland for him,

00:24:49.360 --> 00:24:51.200
Forced women into brothels and killed travelers.

00:24:51.280 --> 00:24:52.880
Their crimes are too numerous to count.

00:24:53.240 --> 00:24:54.680
Shazhou borders Beijian.

00:24:55.400 --> 00:24:56.760
Though it's a military stronghold,

00:24:57.200 --> 00:24:58.440
The emperor is far away.

00:24:58.520 --> 00:24:59.560
With the border garrison,

00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:01.280
No one bothers governing Shazhou.

00:25:01.360 --> 00:25:02.480
Here in Shazhou,

00:25:03.280 --> 00:25:04.600
Ding Chong is the emperor.

00:25:06.560 --> 00:25:07.880
Is there a black market in Shazhou?

00:25:08.840 --> 00:25:10.480
Jiuyou City sells contraband from everywhere.

00:25:10.920 --> 00:25:12.320
As long as you can pay,

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:13.840
There's nothing they won't sell.

00:25:13.920 --> 00:25:14.760
Where is it?

00:25:15.280 --> 00:25:17.400
Go three li south from Bofeng House

00:25:17.480 --> 00:25:18.960
Until you reach a poplar grove.

00:25:19.520 --> 00:25:21.000
Then follow the riverbed east,

00:25:21.080 --> 00:25:21.920
And you'll...

00:25:23.960 --> 00:25:24.800
Young master,

00:25:25.480 --> 00:25:27.960
Shazhou's terrain is extremely complicated.

00:25:28.040 --> 00:25:29.320
Untie me first,

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:31.000
And I'll draw you a detailed map.

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:35.000
In that case,

00:25:36.160 --> 00:25:38.320
You can lead me there yourself.

00:25:38.400 --> 00:25:40.480
You'll still have to untie me first.

00:25:42.120 --> 00:25:44.400
After all, I'm just a weak woman.

00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:46.240
Enough tricks.

00:25:46.880 --> 00:25:48.600
Until I know why you had that weapon,

00:25:48.680 --> 00:25:50.000
You're not going anywhere.

00:25:51.560 --> 00:25:52.960
We're going to Jiuyou City now.

00:25:53.520 --> 00:25:54.840
It's too late today.

00:25:55.600 --> 00:25:58.160
Jiuyou City opens at dusk and closes at midnight.

00:25:58.240 --> 00:25:59.160
Tomorrow night, then.

00:26:00.600 --> 00:26:02.200
You're selfish,

00:26:02.280 --> 00:26:03.440
A habitual liar,

00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:05.160
And when exposed, you talk your way out.

00:26:05.520 --> 00:26:07.680
You feign innocence and pity with ease.

00:26:07.760 --> 00:26:10.120
You're cunning, deceitful and two-faced.

00:26:10.200 --> 00:26:12.000
How do I know this isn't another lie?

00:26:14.840 --> 00:26:17.240
You really have me figured out.

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:22.680
I'll take you to the gates of Jiuyou City,

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:25.400
But let me leave immediately after.

00:26:25.480 --> 00:26:27.120
Fuzhi's restaurant has just opened,

00:26:27.200 --> 00:26:28.320
I have an exam to prepare for.

00:26:29.040 --> 00:26:30.160
We're only two ordinary women

00:26:30.240 --> 00:26:32.280
Trying to survive in this world.

00:26:32.360 --> 00:26:34.360
Who would dare enter terrifying Jiuyou City,

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:36.680
Let alone weapons or Ding Chong.

00:26:37.680 --> 00:26:39.480
That much sounds believable.

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:42.800
You were awfully anxious over this registration form.

00:26:43.880 --> 00:26:45.440
Are you hoping to become an official?

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:47.120
None of your concern.

00:26:48.520 --> 00:26:49.680
This world has left me

00:26:51.440 --> 00:26:52.520
Only one path.

00:26:57.240 --> 00:26:58.720
Sister Ah Xiang...

00:26:58.800 --> 00:27:01.040
I'm all alone now.

00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:03.200
What am I supposed to do?

00:27:03.920 --> 00:27:05.200
Your Sister Ah Xiang

00:27:06.200 --> 00:27:08.520
Would want you to live and grow strong.

00:27:10.240 --> 00:27:12.200
I want to avenge her.

00:27:14.920 --> 00:27:16.320
I want those villains

00:27:16.400 --> 00:27:18.720
To suffer a hundred, a thousand times more than she did.

00:27:18.800 --> 00:27:19.720
Hatred

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:22.520
Only blinds you

00:27:23.240 --> 00:27:24.840
Until you can no longer see your path.

00:27:25.320 --> 00:27:26.560
There are many ways

00:27:27.920 --> 00:27:29.120
To seek justice.

00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:36.040
The best revenge

00:27:36.560 --> 00:27:38.000
Is to become powerful.

00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:41.040
How can I become powerful like you?

00:27:41.120 --> 00:27:43.080
Study. Pass the highest imperial exam.

00:27:43.560 --> 00:27:44.560
Enter government service.

00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:46.880
Once authority is in your hands,

00:27:46.960 --> 00:27:48.320
Everything will change.

00:27:54.560 --> 00:27:56.480
The women's exam was suspended for three cycles.

00:27:56.560 --> 00:27:58.040
This is the first since then.

00:27:59.200 --> 00:28:01.960
Yet the court charges each candidate 100 taels.

00:28:02.640 --> 00:28:04.000
How many women in Shazhou

00:28:04.080 --> 00:28:05.680
Have been shut out by that price?

00:28:07.280 --> 00:28:09.080
I still haven't saved enough.

00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:11.680
Only entering government brings power.

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:14.400
This registration form is my life.

00:28:14.480 --> 00:28:15.400
Absurd.

00:28:16.200 --> 00:28:18.040
When did the court ever charge examination fees?

00:28:18.120 --> 00:28:20.520
In Shazhou, Ding Chong's word is the court's law.

00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:22.240
The exam is near.

00:28:22.320 --> 00:28:23.320
I only acted in self-defense.

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:24.240
What's wrong with that?

00:28:24.320 --> 00:28:25.760
A sound argument.

00:28:25.840 --> 00:28:27.240
Quite convincing.

00:28:28.320 --> 00:28:30.120
But I can never tell your truths from lies.

00:28:30.720 --> 00:28:32.800
When we reach Jiuyou City,

00:28:32.880 --> 00:28:34.400
I'll return the form to you.

00:28:38.520 --> 00:28:44.920
"Drink one more cup of wine,

00:28:45.440 --> 00:28:49.040
For west of Yang Pass,

00:28:49.120 --> 00:28:54.000
You'll find no old friends."

00:28:54.080 --> 00:28:55.200
Governor Ding.

00:28:56.320 --> 00:28:57.520
Your sister, Madam Jiang,

00:28:57.600 --> 00:28:59.440
Sent the jewelry shop's share of the profits

00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:00.360
And its customer list.

00:29:01.160 --> 00:29:02.600
And Jiuyou City's accounts.

00:29:03.160 --> 00:29:05.520
These deals could cost us our heads.

00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:06.920
Tell Feng Lu

00:29:07.000 --> 00:29:08.320
To sell them discreetly next time.

00:29:08.720 --> 00:29:11.560
Don't let his lackeys flaunt them in public.

00:29:11.640 --> 00:29:12.560
It's far too conspicuous.

00:29:13.160 --> 00:29:14.840
With you backing him,

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:16.880
Of course Master Feng ignores that.

00:29:16.960 --> 00:29:18.880
Madam Feng died today,

00:29:18.960 --> 00:29:21.360
And forced the whole city to mourn.

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:23.520
They hacked a groom to death

00:29:23.600 --> 00:29:25.200
And injured many others.

00:29:25.920 --> 00:29:27.320
That idiot.

00:29:27.400 --> 00:29:28.400
That fool brings only trouble.

00:29:29.640 --> 00:29:31.400
Hall Master Feng knew he'd troubled you,

00:29:33.280 --> 00:29:36.360
So he sent an extra tribute.

00:29:36.440 --> 00:29:38.080
At least he has some sense.

00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.560
Uncle!

00:29:44.640 --> 00:29:45.800
Uncle!

00:29:46.680 --> 00:29:47.800
Slow down.

00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:48.720
Uncle!

00:29:48.800 --> 00:29:49.840
Did Yan Fuzhi pay tribute

00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:51.200
When she opened her restaurant?

00:29:51.920 --> 00:29:52.760
What tribute?

00:29:53.160 --> 00:29:54.080
Governor,

00:29:54.800 --> 00:29:56.720
The Yan family's daughter took over Bofeng House.

00:29:56.800 --> 00:29:58.200
It reopened today.

00:29:58.760 --> 00:30:00.640
She specially invited Situ Xue

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:02.840
From the capital's Huiyin Music House.

00:30:02.920 --> 00:30:05.200
They say she's the capital's top dancer

00:30:05.800 --> 00:30:08.080
And a peerless beauty.

00:30:09.400 --> 00:30:11.760
Who is prettier, Situ Xue or me?

00:30:11.840 --> 00:30:13.400
Situ Xue, of course.

00:30:15.520 --> 00:30:17.760
Naturally, Lady Mei'er is far more radiant.

00:30:17.840 --> 00:30:19.760
Situ Xue is merely a performer.

00:30:20.120 --> 00:30:21.960
How could she compare to Lady Mei'er?

00:30:23.840 --> 00:30:25.280
Uncle!

00:30:25.920 --> 00:30:28.640
Yan Fuzhi clearly has no respect for you.

00:30:29.160 --> 00:30:31.280
She didn't even send an invitation to the opening.

00:30:31.360 --> 00:30:33.720
She also helped Meng Tinghui bully me.

00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:35.080
Look, Uncle.

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:37.200
Meng Tinghui did this to my neck.

00:30:37.280 --> 00:30:39.240
They nearly killed me.

00:30:40.120 --> 00:30:42.320
You have to teach them a lesson.

00:30:42.400 --> 00:30:44.480
Meng Tinghui did it last exam too.

00:30:44.560 --> 00:30:45.600
She sold predictions early,

00:30:45.680 --> 00:30:46.880
So I came in last.

00:30:48.320 --> 00:30:49.800
You dare mention that exam?

00:30:49.880 --> 00:30:51.120
Without my approval,

00:30:51.200 --> 00:30:53.160
You wouldn't even have made the list.

00:30:53.240 --> 00:30:55.240
I've arranged the metropolitan exam

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:57.320
And your journey to the capital.

00:30:57.400 --> 00:30:59.400
But at least pretend to study.

00:30:59.920 --> 00:31:01.400
That's what matters.

00:31:01.480 --> 00:31:03.560
Stop fighting with an orphan all day.

00:31:03.640 --> 00:31:05.160
I understand, Uncle.

00:31:05.240 --> 00:31:06.120
When the time comes,

00:31:06.200 --> 00:31:08.080
I'll arrange for you

00:31:08.160 --> 00:31:09.480
A respectable

00:31:09.560 --> 00:31:11.320
And easy post as a female official.

00:31:11.400 --> 00:31:12.240
Would you like that?

00:31:12.640 --> 00:31:13.960
Of course!

00:31:14.040 --> 00:31:16.120
Thank you, Uncle. I knew you loved me best.

00:31:16.200 --> 00:31:17.640
I knew you'd stand up for me.

00:31:17.720 --> 00:31:18.640
Wait.

00:31:18.720 --> 00:31:20.560
Are you still wearing last month's jewelry?

00:31:20.960 --> 00:31:22.360
Honestly, child.

00:31:22.920 --> 00:31:24.880
Here. Buy yourself several new pieces.

00:31:25.200 --> 00:31:26.560
Thank you, Uncle. I'll be going.

00:31:26.640 --> 00:31:29.160
Study, and don't finish last again.

00:31:29.240 --> 00:31:30.160
I know.

00:31:31.400 --> 00:31:33.480
That girl is utterly flighty.

00:31:33.560 --> 00:31:35.160
Just like that short-lived father of hers.

00:31:35.240 --> 00:31:36.560
A pretty face,

00:31:36.640 --> 00:31:37.920
But not a thought in her head.

00:31:38.800 --> 00:31:39.720
Right.

00:31:40.000 --> 00:31:42.120
Have all the entrance fees

00:31:42.200 --> 00:31:43.040
Been collected?

00:32:19.640 --> 00:32:20.600
Left Chancellor,

00:32:20.680 --> 00:32:22.360
It's already the third watch.

00:32:22.440 --> 00:32:23.880
Still reviewing memorials?

00:32:24.480 --> 00:32:25.720
Yet this young emperor

00:32:25.800 --> 00:32:28.640
Slipped out of the palace during his seclusion.

00:32:28.720 --> 00:32:30.160
It is utterly improper.

00:32:31.360 --> 00:32:34.640
Young men craving distant scenery

00:32:34.720 --> 00:32:36.280
Are hardly unusual.

00:32:36.960 --> 00:32:38.200
But I never expected

00:32:38.280 --> 00:32:42.240
Him to bring the farce of women's exams to court.

00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:45.040
Did the previous dynasty's three suspensions

00:32:45.120 --> 00:32:46.520
Teach us nothing?

00:32:47.400 --> 00:32:48.560
When hens crow at dawn,

00:32:48.640 --> 00:32:50.640
Calamity befalls the home and state.

00:32:51.160 --> 00:32:52.520
The fate of this realm

00:32:52.600 --> 00:32:54.680
Cannot be stitched in a powder room.

00:32:55.000 --> 00:32:56.120
Your Excellency is wise.

00:32:57.320 --> 00:32:58.640
Those sheltered women

00:32:58.720 --> 00:33:01.400
May not have even finished The Nine Chapters.

00:33:01.480 --> 00:33:03.480
How could they govern the realm?

00:33:03.560 --> 00:33:04.680
As for His Majesty,

00:33:06.040 --> 00:33:09.200
He used seclusion as a pretext

00:33:09.280 --> 00:33:10.760
To secretly visit Shazhou.

00:33:11.880 --> 00:33:13.480
Was it merely youthful impulse,

00:33:13.560 --> 00:33:16.200
Or does he have another purpose?

00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:26.080
(Wan Kai, Minister of Justice)

00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:28.240
He is still only a child.

00:33:29.640 --> 00:33:30.920
He poses no threat.

00:33:31.760 --> 00:33:33.600
I've already sent Huo An to Shazhou

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:35.720
To bring His Majesty back to Shengzu Hall.

00:33:36.520 --> 00:33:39.640
Otherwise, when the seclusion ends,

00:33:39.720 --> 00:33:41.440
The dignity of Great Ning

00:33:41.520 --> 00:33:43.840
Will become the realm's laughingstock.

00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.280
Mengmeng!

00:33:57.600 --> 00:33:59.000
Mengmeng, wake up!

00:33:59.080 --> 00:34:00.160
Mengmeng, get dressed!

00:34:00.240 --> 00:34:01.400
Downstairs is packed.

00:34:01.480 --> 00:34:03.320
They all came for Situ Xue.

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:04.680
We're going to be rich!

00:34:04.760 --> 00:34:05.720
Mengmeng,

00:34:05.800 --> 00:34:07.520
You truly are my lucky star!

00:34:09.720 --> 00:34:10.800
Brazen lecher!

00:34:11.880 --> 00:34:13.440
How dare you enter Mengmeng's room?

00:34:13.520 --> 00:34:14.720
Mengmeng!

00:34:14.800 --> 00:34:15.960
Did he touch you?

00:34:16.680 --> 00:34:17.560
Are you all right?

00:34:18.240 --> 00:34:19.200
Fuzhi.

00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:22.720
You lecher! I'll kill you!

00:34:24.920 --> 00:34:26.040
I'll chop you to pieces!

00:34:28.280 --> 00:34:29.440
As expected of Shazhou.

00:34:30.560 --> 00:34:31.800
The locals are certainly fierce.

00:34:34.520 --> 00:34:35.880
How dare you call me fierce?

00:34:36.360 --> 00:34:37.280
Prepare to die!

00:34:39.560 --> 00:34:41.760
Fuzhi, he didn't lay a hand on me.

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:42.760
Then who is he?

00:34:42.840 --> 00:34:45.120
Why was he in your room at dawn?

00:34:45.200 --> 00:34:46.680
Yesterday, outside Bofeng House,

00:34:46.760 --> 00:34:48.120
This young master saved us.

00:34:48.200 --> 00:34:50.040
I feared Black Tiger Hall would hunt him down,

00:34:50.120 --> 00:34:51.360
So I let him hide here.

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:55.840
So you're our savior. Please forgive me.

00:34:55.920 --> 00:34:58.240
Yesterday was chaotic. I barely saw you.

00:34:58.320 --> 00:35:01.680
Such clear eyes and noble brows.

00:35:01.760 --> 00:35:04.360
A face like jade, handsome and dashing.

00:35:04.440 --> 00:35:05.400
What noble bearing.

00:35:05.480 --> 00:35:06.520
Fuzhi.

00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:09.120
He knows I'm not Situ Xue.

00:35:12.320 --> 00:35:13.560
Then even our savior must die.

00:35:13.840 --> 00:35:15.720
Mengmeng impersonated Situ Xue for my sake.

00:35:15.800 --> 00:35:17.200
Bofeng House is mine.

00:35:17.280 --> 00:35:19.160
Now that you know our secret,

00:35:19.240 --> 00:35:20.600
You cannot live. Prepare to die!

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:24.840
No wonder you're like sisters.

00:35:25.520 --> 00:35:26.960
You have exactly the same temper.

00:35:30.880 --> 00:35:31.720
Mengmeng.

00:35:32.520 --> 00:35:35.000
You're posing as Situ Xue for money, aren't you?

00:35:35.440 --> 00:35:36.720
Let me teach Miss Meng

00:35:36.800 --> 00:35:37.880
How to perfect the disguise.

00:35:39.240 --> 00:35:40.640
Situ Xue was born in the third month

00:35:41.120 --> 00:35:42.280
And adores crabapple blossoms.

00:35:46.800 --> 00:35:48.000
With this crabapple flower,

00:35:51.480 --> 00:35:53.400
Miss Meng is Situ Xue.

00:36:05.240 --> 00:36:07.840
I didn't realize you knew Situ Xue.

00:36:07.920 --> 00:36:09.280
We nearly attacked one of our own.

00:36:09.360 --> 00:36:10.480
We're practically family.

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:12.480
-Who says we're family? -Who says we're family?

00:36:15.280 --> 00:36:16.120
Still,

00:36:16.680 --> 00:36:18.480
Even brothers settle accounts.

00:36:19.720 --> 00:36:20.640
Last night's lodging,

00:36:20.720 --> 00:36:21.680
Today's fright,

00:36:21.760 --> 00:36:23.080
Repairs to the wall,

00:36:23.760 --> 00:36:25.040
-Medical expenses. -For both hands.

00:36:25.120 --> 00:36:26.280
Add it all together.

00:36:26.360 --> 00:36:28.160
Triple the room rate, paid now in banknotes.

00:36:31.600 --> 00:36:34.400
You're not trying to dodge the bill, are you?

00:36:40.560 --> 00:36:43.280
Translucent and warm to the touch.

00:36:44.320 --> 00:36:45.160
Excellent jade.

00:36:45.520 --> 00:36:46.600
What is your name?

00:36:46.680 --> 00:36:47.720
He Du.

00:36:47.800 --> 00:36:50.240
Keep this jade pendant as collateral.

00:36:50.320 --> 00:36:51.280
When my companion arrives,

00:36:51.360 --> 00:36:52.600
I'll pay the lodging in full.

00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:54.160
All right.

00:36:54.240 --> 00:36:55.160
With this jade pendant,

00:36:55.240 --> 00:36:56.920
-Master He, you can stay forever. -No.

00:36:57.000 --> 00:36:58.160
I'm taking you away today.

00:37:00.720 --> 00:37:02.760
You two may leave.

00:37:03.520 --> 00:37:04.400
Sure.

00:37:07.000 --> 00:37:09.000
Fuzhi, he has to leave.

00:37:09.720 --> 00:37:10.840
For the jade pendant's sake,

00:37:10.920 --> 00:37:12.200
Stop holding it against him.

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:14.120
That pendant could buy ten homes in Shazhou.

00:37:14.200 --> 00:37:15.760
He's important and too conspicuous.

00:37:15.840 --> 00:37:17.160
He'll bring Bofeng House trouble.

00:37:17.240 --> 00:37:18.080
He has to go.

00:37:18.160 --> 00:37:19.240
I need my form back too.

00:37:19.320 --> 00:37:20.160
Registration form?

00:37:22.120 --> 00:37:24.360
Come take a look!

00:37:25.360 --> 00:37:28.120
Miss Meng, I just found these old books.

00:37:28.200 --> 00:37:29.280
I saved them for you.

00:37:33.040 --> 00:37:33.920
Thank you, sir.

00:37:34.160 --> 00:37:35.000
You're welcome.

00:37:35.960 --> 00:37:36.800
Come again.

00:37:42.440 --> 00:37:44.360
Black boots and lion-patterned belts.

00:37:44.440 --> 00:37:45.480
Gold-buckled sabers.

00:37:45.920 --> 00:37:47.720
They must be commanders from the capital.

00:37:51.400 --> 00:37:52.480
Search everywhere!

00:37:52.560 --> 00:37:54.160
Turn the city upside down if you must!

00:37:54.840 --> 00:37:56.160
-Search! -What are you doing?

00:38:12.520 --> 00:38:13.840
Brother, look.

00:38:21.040 --> 00:38:21.880
Go.

00:38:34.120 --> 00:38:35.920
Master He, we need to hurry.

00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:38.760
The Jiuyou market won't wait.

00:38:40.920 --> 00:38:42.560
Meng Tinghui?

00:38:45.280 --> 00:38:47.960
Where did you hook another rich young lord?

00:38:48.040 --> 00:38:49.640
You certainly have a talent for it.

00:38:49.720 --> 00:38:51.240
A rootless orphan like you

00:38:51.320 --> 00:38:52.720
No one would even marry you,

00:38:52.800 --> 00:38:54.760
Yet you landed a rich young lord.

00:38:55.280 --> 00:38:57.200
Not every woman relies on marriage

00:38:57.280 --> 00:38:58.920
To change her fate like you, Madam Yan.

00:38:59.400 --> 00:39:01.280
Not that you could change yours.

00:39:01.800 --> 00:39:03.560
I hear you offended Jiang Mei'er.

00:39:03.640 --> 00:39:04.960
Still dreaming of the imperial exam?

00:39:05.960 --> 00:39:08.120
All these years, you've coaxed Fuzhi

00:39:08.200 --> 00:39:10.520
Into letting you freeload off the Yan family.

00:39:10.600 --> 00:39:12.480
Otherwise, you'd be wandering the streets.

00:39:12.560 --> 00:39:13.800
Mind your words, Madam Yan.

00:39:14.360 --> 00:39:16.000
I work my way through the women's academy.

00:39:16.080 --> 00:39:17.840
I've never taken a thing from the Yan family.

00:39:18.120 --> 00:39:19.560
But you, Madam Yan,

00:39:19.640 --> 00:39:22.040
Dressed in silk and dripping with jewels...

00:39:22.480 --> 00:39:23.520
The Yan family accounts

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:25.200
Won't bear close scrutiny.

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:27.560
You can turn black into white.

00:39:27.640 --> 00:39:29.840
You've lived by swindling people since childhood

00:39:29.920 --> 00:39:31.240
And you're always scheming.

00:39:31.600 --> 00:39:33.880
No wonder Fuzhi trusts you completely.

00:39:35.400 --> 00:39:37.520
Master Yan, you're here.

00:39:37.600 --> 00:39:38.840
Husband.

00:39:39.880 --> 00:39:40.880
"Husband."

00:39:42.120 --> 00:39:43.800
You call me a scheming swindler,

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:45.720
But your performance

00:39:45.800 --> 00:39:46.880
Is far more convincing.

00:39:51.200 --> 00:39:52.040
Young master,

00:39:52.480 --> 00:39:54.800
You seem distinguished, so heed my warning.

00:39:55.360 --> 00:39:57.200
Stay away from this wicked girl.

00:39:57.480 --> 00:39:59.560
She'll kill you for your money.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.440
When I was pregnant,

00:40:01.520 --> 00:40:03.440
She pushed me down the steps.

00:40:03.520 --> 00:40:05.840
You were vicious even as a child.

00:40:18.560 --> 00:40:19.920
You can still leave.

00:40:20.920 --> 00:40:22.960
Miss Meng only grows more interesting.

00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:25.120
Aren't we going to Jiuyou City?

00:40:25.760 --> 00:40:27.320
I already gave you a chance.

00:40:27.840 --> 00:40:28.840
You won't leave?

00:40:28.920 --> 00:40:30.320
Then don't blame me.

00:41:04.560 --> 00:41:06.360
Meng Tinghui is quite resourceful.

00:41:07.120 --> 00:41:09.120
She gathered all of you in one place.

00:41:09.520 --> 00:41:11.960
Brothers, what road are you from?

00:41:12.040 --> 00:41:13.680
Call out so we don't strike our own.

00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:15.440
This brat knows how to fight.

00:41:15.760 --> 00:41:16.960
Let's work together.

00:41:17.040 --> 00:41:18.480
We'll break his legs first.

00:41:46.080 --> 00:41:47.240
-Mercy, my lord! -Mercy, my lord!

00:41:47.320 --> 00:41:49.840
-We won't do it again! -Never again!

00:41:49.920 --> 00:41:51.880
-Mercy, my lord! -Mercy, my lord!

00:41:53.280 --> 00:41:54.400
-We'll never do it again! -Mercy!

00:41:54.480 --> 00:41:56.280
-Mercy, my lord! -Mercy, my lord!

00:42:11.720 --> 00:42:14.680
Where did this Shazhou army blade come from?

00:42:16.104 --> 00:42:18.104
MkvDrama.Net

